# Skill router (mandatory)

Before nontrivial work, select and **read** every matching project skill below. Do not skip a skill because you “already know” it — open `SKILL.md` (and linked files when needed).

| If the task involves… | Read |
|------------------------|------|
| Design, features, MVP scope, CONCEPT, mechanics, economy, modes | `.cursor/skills/game-concept/SKILL.md` |
| Any code write/edit/refactor/debug/optimize | `.cursor/skills/clean-programming/SKILL.md` |
| Imports, new `src/` files, GameApp/RaceRenderer/vehicle size, layer leaks | `.cursor/skills/architecture/SKILL.md` |
| Review, QA, playtest, UX check, regression, “does it work for players” | `.cursor/skills/review-testing/SKILL.md` |
| Images, UI art, VFX, mockups, visuals, CSS look, GenerateImage | `.cursor/skills/asphalt-comic-art/SKILL.md` |
| Tracks, levels, cups, free/ad-hoc, obstacles, level JSON | `.cursor/skills/level-editor/SKILL.md` |
| Tripo, GLB bake, 3D cars/parts/FX/garage/track kit meshes | `.cursor/skills/tripo-3d-assets/SKILL.md` (+ asphalt-comic-art) |
| Named meshes/nodes, car/garage/track coordinates, “move this part” commands | `.cursor/cheatsheets/README.md` |
| Driving physics, race feel, grip/slide, jumps, nitro, mass shove, car stats→forces | `.cursor/skills/arcade-physics/SKILL.md` (+ clean-programming; game-concept if CONCEPT §4 moves) |

After each implementation step: version → commit on `master` → push (see `.cursor/rules/delivery-workflow.mdc`). No feature branches.

**Start scripts** (`start.sh`, `start.bat`, `start.ps1`) must always keep working — see `.cursor/rules/start-scripts.mdc`.

**Multi-match is normal** (e.g. new race feature → game-concept + clean-programming + review-testing; physics feel → arcade-physics + clean-programming; new Tripo part → tripo-3d-assets + asphalt-comic-art + clean-programming).

**Default baseline for implementation tasks:** `game-concept` + `clean-programming` + `architecture`. Add others as the table requires. Finish player-facing work with `review-testing` (**start server + browser**). After `src/` import/ownership edits, `npm run test:arch` must pass.
